{"id":"metro-tiles","title":"Metro — Windows 8 Tiles","description":"The Metro / Modern UI era (2011–2013) — solid colour tiles with no borders, no shadows and no radius, Segoe UI Light typography, live tiles that flip on their own, and apps that open full-screen.","tags":["metro","tiles","windows8"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:37:52.620Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Metro — Windows 8 Tiles\ndescription: The Metro / Modern UI era (2011–2013) — solid colour tiles with no borders, no shadows and no radius, Segoe UI Light typography, live tiles that flip on their own, and apps that open full-screen.\ntags: [metro, tiles, windows8]\norder: 12\n---\n\n# Metro — Windows 8 Tiles\n\nThe bridge between glossy Web 2.0 and flat minimalism: Microsoft's Metro language. Every\ntile is a solid rectangle of pure colour, typography is huge and light, and the whole\n\"start screen\" scrolls sideways.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#1a1a1f` near-black |\n| Tile palette | blue `#2672ec` · teal `#00aba9` · green `#00a300` · orange `#f09609` · pink `#d80073` · red `#e51400` · purple `#7e3878` |\n| Tiles | 84px unit, 8px gap, **zero** border/radius/shadow |\n| Type | \"Segoe UI Light\" 200–300 weight, huge headers |\n| Motion | live-tile flip every 3s; click a tile → full-screen app with back arrow |\n\n## Structure\n\nHorizontally-scrolling start screen: group \"Mail & People\" (with a live mail tile) →\ngroup \"Media\" → group \"Fun\". Click any tile — the \"app\" opens full-screen in its colour.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Metro — Windows 8 Tiles\n\nThe bridge between glossy Web 2.0 and flat minimalism: Microsoft's Metro language. Every\ntile is a solid rectangle of pure colour, typography is huge and light, and the whole\n\"start screen\" scrolls sideways.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#1a1a1f` near-black |\n| Tile palette | blue `#2672ec` · teal `#00aba9` · green `#00a300` · orange `#f09609` · pink `#d80073` · red `#e51400` · purple `#7e3878` |\n| Tiles | 84px unit, 8px gap, **zero** border/radius/shadow |\n| Type | \"Segoe UI Light\" 200–300 weight, huge headers |\n| Motion | live-tile flip every 3s; click a tile → full-screen app with back arrow |\n\n## Structure\n\nHorizontally-scrolling start screen: group \"Mail & People\" (with a live mail tile) →\ngroup \"Media\" → group \"Fun\". Click any tile — the \"app\" opens full-screen in its colour.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Start — Metro Tiles\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  html, body { height: 100%; }\n  body { background: #1a1a1f; color: #fff; font-family: \"Segoe UI\", \"Segoe UI Light\", system-ui, sans-serif; overflow: hidden; }\n\n  .start { height: 100vh; overflow-x: auto; overflow-y: hidden; padding: 34px 56px 20px; scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n  .start::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 10px; }\n  .start::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #3a3a44; }\n\n  .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  .top h1 { font-size: 42px; font-weight: 200; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .user { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 300; font-size: 15px; color: #cfcfd6; }\n  .user .pic { width: 40px; height: 40px; background: #d80073; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 19px; }\n\n  .groups { display: flex; gap: 70px; align-items: flex-start; width: max-content; padding-bottom: 12px; }\n  .group { flex: none; }\n  .ghead { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 300; color: #9a9aa5; margin: 4px 0 12px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }\n  .ghead .more { font-size: 22px; color: #2672ec; cursor: pointer; line-height: 1; }\n  .ghead .more:hover { color: #fff; }\n\n  .tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 84px); grid-auto-rows: 84px; gap: 8px; }\n  .tile { border: 0; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; padding: 8px 10px; color: #fff; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; overflow: hidden; position: relative; outline-offset: 3px; }\n  .tile:hover { outline: 2px solid #cfcfd6; }\n  .tile .glyph { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -54%); font-size: 34px; line-height: 1; }\n  .t-wide { grid-column: span 2; }\n  .t-big { grid-column: span 2; grid-row: span 2; }\n  .t-big .glyph { font-size: 64px; }\n  .tile .name { position: relative; z-index: 2; }\n\n  /* live tile — flips between two faces */\n  .live { perspective: 400px; }\n  .live .faces { position: absolute; inset: 0; transform-style: preserve-3d; animation: flip 5.5s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  .live .face { position: absolute; inset: 0; backface-visibility: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 4px; }\n  .live .face .big-g { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; }\n  .live .face .cnt { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; }\n  .live .face.b { transform: rotateX(180deg); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28); }\n  @keyframes flip { 0%, 42% { transform: rotateX(0); } 50%, 92% { transform: rotateX(180deg); } 100% { transform: rotateX(360deg); } }\n\n  /* app overlay */\n  .app { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 20; display: none; flex-direction: column; padding: 46px 60px; }\n  .app.on { display: flex; animation: appin 0.28s ease; }\n  @keyframes appin { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1.06); } }\n  .app .back { background: none; border: 1.5px solid #fff; color: #fff; width: 44px; height: 44px; font-size: 19px; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n  .app .back:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); }\n  .app h1 { font-size: 52px; font-weight: 200; }\n  .app p { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); margin-top: 10px; max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .app .fake { margin-top: 34px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 150px); gap: 12px; }\n  .app .fake div { height: 110px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 34px; }\n\n  .hint { position: fixed; bottom: 14px; left: 56px; color: #55555f; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 300; }\n  @media (max-width: 700px) { .start { padding: 24px 24px 16px; overflow-y: auto; } .groups { flex-direction: column; gap: 40px; width: auto; } body { overflow: auto; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"start\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"top\">\n      \u003ch1>Start\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"user\">\u003cdiv class=\"pic\">😊\u003c/div> Aku\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"groups\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"group\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ghead\">Mail &amp; People \u003cspan class=\"more\">→\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tiles\">\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile live t-big\" style=\"background:#2672ec\" data-app=\"Mail\" data-c=\"#2672ec\">\n            \u003cspan class=\"faces\">\n              \u003cspan class=\"face\">\u003cspan class=\"big-g\">✉\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"cnt\">4 unread\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\n              \u003cspan class=\"face b\">\u003cspan class=\"big-g\">📎\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"cnt\">1 attachment\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\n            \u003c/span>\n            \u003cspan class=\"name\">Mail\u003c/span>\n          \u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#00a300\" data-app=\"Calendar\" data-c=\"#00a300\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">📅\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Calendar\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#7e3878\" data-app=\"People\" data-c=\"#7e3878\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">👤\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">People\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile t-wide\" style=\"background:#00aba9\" data-app=\"Messaging\" data-c=\"#00aba9\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">💬\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Messaging\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#d80073\" data-app=\"Photos\" data-c=\"#d80073\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">📷\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Photos\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#2672ec\" data-app=\"SkyDrive\" data-c=\"#2672ec\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">☁\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">SkyDrive\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"group\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ghead\">Media \u003cspan class=\"more\">→\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tiles\">\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile t-wide\" style=\"background:#e51400\" data-app=\"Video\" data-c=\"#e51400\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">▶\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Video\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile t-big\" style=\"background:#f09609\" data-app=\"Music\" data-c=\"#f09609\">\n            \u003cspan class=\"glyph\">♫\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Music\u003c/span>\n          \u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#00aba9\" data-app=\"Camera\" data-c=\"#00aba9\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">📷\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Camera\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#2672ec\" data-app=\"News\" data-c=\"#2672ec\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">📰\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">News\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"group\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ghead\">Fun \u003cspan class=\"more\">→\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tiles\">\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#d80073\" data-app=\"Solitaire\" data-c=\"#d80073\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">🃏\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Solitaire\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#00a300\" data-app=\"Xbox Games\" data-c=\"#00a300\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">🎮\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Games\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#f09609\" data-app=\"Store\" data-c=\"#f09609\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">🛍\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Store\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#7e3878\" data-app=\"Paint\" data-c=\"#7e3878\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">🖌\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Paint\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"app\" id=\"app\">\n    \u003cbutton class=\"back\" id=\"back\">◀\u003c/button>\n    \u003ch1 id=\"appName\">Mail\u003c/h1>\n    \u003cp>Semua app dalam Windows 8 buka full-screen begini — warna penuh, typography besar, dan butang back semata-mata. Tekan ◀ untuk kembali ke Start.\u003c/p>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"fake\">\u003cdiv>📁\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>📊\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>🌐\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"hint\">Scroll sideways → · Click a tile to open its app\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    const appEl = document.getElementById('app');\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tile').forEach(t => {\n      t.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        document.getElementById('appName').textContent = t.dataset.app;\n        appEl.style.background = t.dataset.c || '#2672ec';\n        appEl.classList.add('on');\n      });\n    });\n    document.getElementById('back').addEventListener('click', () => appEl.classList.remove('on'));\n    addEventListener('keydown', e => { if (e.key === 'Escape') appEl.classList.remove('on'); });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Start — Metro Tiles\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  html, body { height: 100%; }\n  body { background: #1a1a1f; color: #fff; font-family: \"Segoe UI\", \"Segoe UI Light\", system-ui, sans-serif; overflow: hidden; }\n\n  .start { height: 100vh; overflow-x: auto; overflow-y: hidden; padding: 34px 56px 20px; scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n  .start::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 10px; }\n  .start::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #3a3a44; }\n\n  .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  .top h1 { font-size: 42px; font-weight: 200; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .user { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 300; font-size: 15px; color: #cfcfd6; }\n  .user .pic { width: 40px; height: 40px; background: #d80073; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 19px; }\n\n  .groups { display: flex; gap: 70px; align-items: flex-start; width: max-content; padding-bottom: 12px; }\n  .group { flex: none; }\n  .ghead { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 300; color: #9a9aa5; margin: 4px 0 12px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }\n  .ghead .more { font-size: 22px; color: #2672ec; cursor: pointer; line-height: 1; }\n  .ghead .more:hover { color: #fff; }\n\n  .tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 84px); grid-auto-rows: 84px; gap: 8px; }\n  .tile { border: 0; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; padding: 8px 10px; color: #fff; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; overflow: hidden; position: relative; outline-offset: 3px; }\n  .tile:hover { outline: 2px solid #cfcfd6; }\n  .tile .glyph { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -54%); font-size: 34px; line-height: 1; }\n  .t-wide { grid-column: span 2; }\n  .t-big { grid-column: span 2; grid-row: span 2; }\n  .t-big .glyph { font-size: 64px; }\n  .tile .name { position: relative; z-index: 2; }\n\n  /* live tile — flips between two faces */\n  .live { perspective: 400px; }\n  .live .faces { position: absolute; inset: 0; transform-style: preserve-3d; animation: flip 5.5s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  .live .face { position: absolute; inset: 0; backface-visibility: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 4px; }\n  .live .face .big-g { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; }\n  .live .face .cnt { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; }\n  .live .face.b { transform: rotateX(180deg); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28); }\n  @keyframes flip { 0%, 42% { transform: rotateX(0); } 50%, 92% { transform: rotateX(180deg); } 100% { transform: rotateX(360deg); } }\n\n  /* app overlay */\n  .app { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 20; display: none; flex-direction: column; padding: 46px 60px; }\n  .app.on { display: flex; animation: appin 0.28s ease; }\n  @keyframes appin { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1.06); } }\n  .app .back { background: none; border: 1.5px solid #fff; color: #fff; width: 44px; height: 44px; font-size: 19px; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n  .app .back:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); }\n  .app h1 { font-size: 52px; font-weight: 200; }\n  .app p { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); margin-top: 10px; max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .app .fake { margin-top: 34px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 150px); gap: 12px; }\n  .app .fake div { height: 110px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 34px; }\n\n  .hint { position: fixed; bottom: 14px; left: 56px; color: #55555f; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 300; }\n  @media (max-width: 700px) { .start { padding: 24px 24px 16px; overflow-y: auto; } .groups { flex-direction: column; gap: 40px; width: auto; } body { overflow: auto; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"start\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"top\">\n      \u003ch1>Start\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"user\">\u003cdiv class=\"pic\">😊\u003c/div> Aku\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"groups\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"group\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ghead\">Mail &amp; People \u003cspan class=\"more\">→\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tiles\">\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile live t-big\" style=\"background:#2672ec\" data-app=\"Mail\" data-c=\"#2672ec\">\n            \u003cspan class=\"faces\">\n              \u003cspan class=\"face\">\u003cspan class=\"big-g\">✉\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"cnt\">4 unread\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\n              \u003cspan class=\"face b\">\u003cspan class=\"big-g\">📎\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"cnt\">1 attachment\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\n            \u003c/span>\n            \u003cspan class=\"name\">Mail\u003c/span>\n          \u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#00a300\" data-app=\"Calendar\" data-c=\"#00a300\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">📅\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Calendar\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#7e3878\" data-app=\"People\" data-c=\"#7e3878\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">👤\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">People\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile t-wide\" style=\"background:#00aba9\" data-app=\"Messaging\" data-c=\"#00aba9\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">💬\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Messaging\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#d80073\" data-app=\"Photos\" data-c=\"#d80073\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">📷\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Photos\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#2672ec\" data-app=\"SkyDrive\" data-c=\"#2672ec\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">☁\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">SkyDrive\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"group\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ghead\">Media \u003cspan class=\"more\">→\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tiles\">\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile t-wide\" style=\"background:#e51400\" data-app=\"Video\" data-c=\"#e51400\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">▶\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Video\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile t-big\" style=\"background:#f09609\" data-app=\"Music\" data-c=\"#f09609\">\n            \u003cspan class=\"glyph\">♫\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Music\u003c/span>\n          \u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#00aba9\" data-app=\"Camera\" data-c=\"#00aba9\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">📷\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Camera\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#2672ec\" data-app=\"News\" data-c=\"#2672ec\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">📰\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">News\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"group\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ghead\">Fun \u003cspan class=\"more\">→\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tiles\">\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#d80073\" data-app=\"Solitaire\" data-c=\"#d80073\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">🃏\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Solitaire\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#00a300\" data-app=\"Xbox Games\" data-c=\"#00a300\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">🎮\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Games\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#f09609\" data-app=\"Store\" data-c=\"#f09609\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">🛍\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Store\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"tile\" style=\"background:#7e3878\" data-app=\"Paint\" data-c=\"#7e3878\">\u003cspan class=\"glyph\">🖌\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"name\">Paint\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"app\" id=\"app\">\n    \u003cbutton class=\"back\" id=\"back\">◀\u003c/button>\n    \u003ch1 id=\"appName\">Mail\u003c/h1>\n    \u003cp>Semua app dalam Windows 8 buka full-screen begini — warna penuh, typography besar, dan butang back semata-mata. Tekan ◀ untuk kembali ke Start.\u003c/p>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"fake\">\u003cdiv>📁\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>📊\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>🌐\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"hint\">Scroll sideways → · Click a tile to open its app\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    const appEl = document.getElementById('app');\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tile').forEach(t => {\n      t.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        document.getElementById('appName').textContent = t.dataset.app;\n        appEl.style.background = t.dataset.c || '#2672ec';\n        appEl.classList.add('on');\n      });\n    });\n    document.getElementById('back').addEventListener('click', () => appEl.classList.remove('on'));\n    addEventListener('keydown', e => { if (e.key === 'Escape') appEl.classList.remove('on'); });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}